---
import DesignLabLayout from '../../layouts/DesignLabLayout.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(p:string)=>`${base}${p.replace(/^\//,'')}`;
---
<DesignLabLayout title="Russia-Thermal Design Lab">
<main class="lab-index">
<p class="eyebrow">Russia-Thermal · Free Astro Design Lab</p>
<h1>Choose the narrative before we choose the visual system.</h1>
<p class="intro">All three prototypes use the same canonical research database. They differ in information density, reading rhythm, and how aggressively they surface the conclusion before evidence.</p>
<div class="choices">
<a href={href('/design-lab/strategy')}><span>01</span><h2>Strategy Consulting</h2><p>Strongest pyramid structure. Best for leadership scanning and explicit action.</p><b>Open prototype →</b></a>
<a href={href('/design-lab/editorial')}><span>02</span><h2>Editorial Research</h2><p>More narrative, more whitespace, more like a research dossier or high-end publication.</p><b>Open prototype →</b></a>
<a href={href('/design-lab/intelligence')}><span>03</span><h2>Research Intelligence</h2><p>Dense technical cockpit for researchers who want comparison, status, and traceability at a glance.</p><b>Open prototype →</b></a>
</div>
<div class="rule"><b>Same truth, three views.</b><p>GitHub remains the SSOT. These pages are disposable presentation experiments.</p></div>
</main>
</DesignLabLayout>
<style>
:global(body){background:#f3f5f7;color:#17202a}.lab-index{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:80px 28px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#356e9d}.lab-index h1{max-width:900px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,74px);font-weight:400;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:14px 0 24px}.intro{max-width:760px;font-size:18px;color:#53606b;line-height:1.6}.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:54px}.choices a{min-height:330px;padding:28px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce1e5;text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.2s}.choices a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 34px rgba(30,50,70,.1)}.choices span{font-size:12px;color:#356e9d;font-weight:900}.choices h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:400}.choices p{color:#5c6973;line-height:1.6}.choices b{margin-top:auto}.rule{margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #cbd1d6;display:flex;gap:30px}.rule p{margin:0;color:#606b74}@media(max-width:800px){.choices{grid-template-columns:1fr}.choices a{min-height:230px}.rule{flex-direction:column}}
</style>